---[<a href="https://github.com/beyond-all-reason/RecoilEngine/blob/master/rts/Lua/LuaDebugExtra.cpp#L155-L160" target="_blank">source</a>]
---
---@param button integer
---@return nil
function debug.emulateMouseRelease(button) end

---Emulate the cursor moving to a screen position.
---
---Fires a MouseMove through the normal pipeline. Coordinates use the bottom-left
---origin like the rest of the Lua screen API. Does not move the OS cursor.
---
---[<a href="https://github.com/beyond-all-reason/RecoilEngine/blob/master/rts/Lua/LuaDebugExtra.cpp#L176-L185" target="_blank">source</a>]
